# Content packs (docs/11 §3.12, layer 1): everything here is ignored except this whitelist. A pack copied in by
# mistake never lands with `git add`; `git add -f` is caught by test_11_ip_firewall (PUBLIC_PACKS / PRIVATE_PACKS).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/PUBLIC_PACKS
!/PRIVATE_PACKS
!/ip_firewall*.json
!/testbild/
